Package: TMTMAKER
Title: Generate Randomized Trail Making Test (TMT) Stimuli
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Luiz Guilherme", "Curi", , "luizg.curi@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Creates randomized Trail Making Test (TMT-A and TMT-B) stimulus
    sheets with configurable number of elements, spacing, and alphabet scripts
    (Latin, Greek, Arabic, Cyrillic). Useful for researchers and clinicians who
    need multiple unique versions of the TMT for neuropsychological assessment.
